{"title": "缓存命中实测：MISS → HIT", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5 容器；后端响应带 Cache-Control: public, max-age=60"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "proxy_cache_path /tmp/cache levels=1:2 keys_zone=my_cache:10m;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/ | grep -i cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "Cache-Control: public, max-age=60"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: MISS"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/ | grep -i cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: HIT"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "MISS 穿透回源并存缓存；HIT 直接吐缓存，后端零感知"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5（docker nginx:alpine 容器）"}
]}
